            <ArticleTitle>Cutaneous Application of Silicone Wafers Containing Carbon Microcoils: Efficacy in Relieving Chronic Muscle Tension and Pain.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>439-43</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1089/acm.2014.0235</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText Label="BACKGROUND" NlmCategory="BACKGROUND">Chronic musculoskeletal pain is highly prevalent worldwide.</AbstractText>
                <AbstractText Label="PRIMARY STUDY OBJECTIVE" NlmCategory="OBJECTIVE">The aim of this study was to evaluate the efficacy of Helical(®) microcoils, a new, noninvasive treatment for chronic musculoskeletal pain.</AbstractText>
                <AbstractText Label="DESIGN" NlmCategory="METHODS">This was a prospective, observational study.</AbstractText>
                <AbstractText Label="SETTING" NlmCategory="METHODS">The study was conducted at the main author's private clinic, in São Paulo, Brazil.</AbstractText>
                <AbstractText Label="PARTICIPANTS" NlmCategory="METHODS">We evaluated 20 physicians, from 2 different hospitals, who suffered from chronic musculoskeletal pain and volunteered to participate in the study.</AbstractText>
                <AbstractText Label="INTERVENTION" NlmCategory="METHODS">The Helical(®) microcoils were applied to the skin over the affected areas. Before and after the intervention, the physician-patients completed questionnaires and a visual analog scale.</AbstractText>
                <AbstractText Label="PRIMARY OUTCOME MEASURES" NlmCategory="METHODS">We quantified postintervention improvement or worsening of pain and muscle tension.</AbstractText>
                <AbstractText Label="RESULTS" NlmCategory="RESULTS">Significant improvements in pain and muscle tension were observed in 95% of the physician-patients evaluated. The only side effect reported was mild pruritus at the application site, which occurred in 5 of the 20 cases.</AbstractText>
                <AbstractText Label="CONCLUSION" NlmCategory="CONCLUSIONS">The use of Helical microcoils was found to be safe and efficacious in relieving muscle tension and pain.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
